PART 1: NON-APP STORE COMPETITORS (SCRIPT-BASED INSTALLS)\
These apps are often chosen by high-volume brands to bypass Shopify App
Store\
limitations and for deeper custom JS control.\
\
1. WISEPOPS\
- Description: High-end conversion platform focusing on non-intrusive
UI.\
- Core Capabilities:\
\* The Notification Feed: A social-media style \"inbox\" (fixed sidebar)
that\
houses multiple non-modal notifications/offers.\
\* AI-Driven Product Recos: Dynamically injects \"Bestsellers\" or
\"Frequently\
Bought Together\" items directly into the popup based on browser
history.\
\* Advanced Targeting: Logic based on Shopify-specific Liquid
variables:\
Cart total, specific Product ID in cart, and Customer Tags.\
\* Multi-Campaign Stacking: Allows running a sticky bar, a central
modal,\
and a feed simultaneously with collision-prevention rules.\
- Impact Assessment:\
\* CTR: The Notification Feed sees a 10-12% engagement rate as it
doesn\'t\
interrupt the user flow.\
\* Conversion %: Personalized AI recommendations within popups increase\
attributed revenue by \~39% compared to static offers.\
- Pricing Slabs:\
\* Free Trial: 14 days.\
\* Paid (\$49/mo): 50k pageviews. Includes A/B testing and Klaviyo
sync.\
\* Enterprise (\$250+/mo): Custom CSS/JS callbacks and headless
support.\
\
2. SLEEKNOTE\
- Description: Focuses on \"on-page assistance\" and high-intent lead
gen.\
- Core Capabilities:\
\* Multi-Step Logic: \"Micro-conversions\" (e.g., Step 1: \"Are you
shopping\
for Men or Women?\" -\> Step 2: Specific email opt-in for that
segment).\
\* SiteData Integration: Real-time trigger based on custom data layers\
(e.g., weather at visitor location, inventory levels).\
\* Page-Level Target Groups: Groups rules (e.g., \"Show if URL contains\
/shoes/ AND visitor is from Instagram\").\
- Impact Assessment:\
\* Conversion %: Multi-step forms increase sign-up rates by \~30% by
reducing\
initial friction.\
\* Bounce Rate: Lower on-load bounce rate due to delayed
\"scroll-depth\"\
triggering (typically set at 30-50% scroll).\
- Pricing Slabs:\
\* Lite (€49/mo): 25k visitors. All basic triggers.\
\* Premium (€114/mo+): Adds Gamification (Spin-to-win) and A/B testing.\
