\
PART 2: SHOPIFY APP STORE NATIVES (DETAILED ANALYSIS)\
\
1. PRIVY POP UPS\
- Description: The market leader for \"Conversion + Email + SMS\"
bundle.\
- Core Capabilities:\
\* Exit-Intent Technology: Precision detection of mouse-out or
back-button\
gestures to trigger a \"Save your cart\" modal.\
\* Cross-Sell Modals: Triggered when a specific item is added to cart,\
suggesting a complementary item with a 1-click \"Add to Cart\" button.\
\* Automatic Coupon Injection: Displays a unique discount code only
after\
email submission, with a \"Click to Copy\" function.\
\* Floating Tabs: Small \"teaser\" tabs that live on the edge of the
screen\
to re-open the popup if closed.\
- Impact Assessment:\
\* CTR: Average 3-5% on exit-intent popups.\
\* Conversion %: Spin-to-Win (Gamification) leads to 2x-3x higher
opt-in\
rates compared to static forms.\
- Pricing Slabs:\
\* Free: Up to 100 mailable contacts. Basic layouts.\
\* Conversion Only (\$24/mo): Removes Privy branding, unlimited
displays,\
A/B testing, and cart-value targeting.\
\* Growth Plan (\$45/mo): Adds SMS capture and automated email
sequences.\
\
2. POP CONVERT\
- Description: Focused on \"Smart Bars\" and lightweight notification
elements.\
- Core Capabilities:\
\* Smart Bars: Dynamic header/footer bars for free shipping thresholds\
(e.g., \"Spend \$20 more for free shipping\").\
\* Interaction-Based Modals: Triggered by clicks on specific site
elements\
(e.g., clicking a \"Size Guide\" triggers a newsletter pop-up).\
\* Geometric Customization: Allows \"Shape\" based popups (circles,
bubbles)\
to stand out from standard square modals.\
\* Social Proof Integration: Can show \"Recent Purchase\" notifications\
within the popup flow.\
- Impact Assessment:\
\* CTR: High for \"Mystery Coupons\" (users click to reveal a random
discount).\
\* Average Order Value (AOV): Smart Bars for shipping thresholds see a\
measurable 10-15% lift in AOV.\
- Pricing Slabs:\
\* Free: 1,000 unique visitors/mo. Basic banners and popups.\
\* Pro (\$29/mo): Unlimited visitors, advanced triggers, and removal of\
Pop Convert branding.\
\* Gamification Add-on (\$13/mo): Specific access to interactive games
like\
Scratch Cards and Wheels.\